job-description-explorer = Work on a ship together with others and do researches in open space.
job-description-security-guard = Catch criminals and enemies of the station, enforce the law, and ensure that the station does not fall into disarray.
job-description-hof = Handle access reassignment fairly using your ID console, manage the Service department, and keep Ian safe.
job-description-frontier-janitor = Keep the station clean of any trash or slipping hazards, and help deal with rat infestations.
